<title>SRI LANKA: Kelani Valley six-month net soar.</title>
<headline>Kelani Valley six-month net soar.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the six months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>		  (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		  392.68    vs	328.82</p>
<p>    Net profit		 55.78    vs	 13.17</p>
<p>NOTE - Kelani Valley Plantations Limited is one of six estate firms privatised in 1995. Company profits are not taxed due to brought forward tax losses.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
